station (Play Integrity, key attestation -- D22's title pun is\n36\tthe attestation `RootOfTrust` ASN.1 record) checks, then obfuscation capstones (flattening, VM, white-box crypto). After it the untouched MASVS\n37\tgroups are AUTH (biometric/local auth) and the leftover IPC surfaces (bound Service/AIDL, broadcast receivers).\n38\tNext expect also: the payload ENCRYPTED/wrapped (key in host dex, unwrap by\n39\tmagic known plaintext), \"challenge-signed\" made real (several payloads, only the one whose digest/signature matches a\n40\tpinned value is loaded), >1 `ANS-` in the payload with the host-named member (`moduleContract`) deciding, class shadowing\n41\tbetween host and payload loaders, multi-stage loaders, anti-tamper / root / emulator / debugger / Frida checks, and\n42\tcontrol-flow flattening or a tiny VM. New codecs keep arriving (d7 caesar, d15 native, d17 indexed, d19 reflection, d20\n43\tdynamic) and old ones recur (d18 xor, d21 reverse): check `data` for `ANS-`, then for an entry name, then decode from `ANS-` alone.\n44\t\n45\tTool status (after `source bin/env.sh`; checked 2026-10-15). INSTALLED: jadx 1.5.6, apktool 3.0.3, aapt, aapt2,\n46\tapksigner, keytool, jarsigner, d2j-dex2jar (+ `tools/dex2jar/d2j-*.sh`: baksmali, decrypt-string, ...), droidasc,\n47\tandroguard (CLI + py), apkInspector, rizin/rz-bin, r2/rabin2, Ghidra `analyzeHeadless`, readelf/nm/strings, hbc-decompiler/\n48\thbc-disassembler/hbc-file-parser (hermes-dec), ilspycmd + dotnet, webcrack, js-beautify, sqlite3, 7z, binwalk, yara,\n49\ttshark, zlib-flate, openssl, adb (no device). py: lief, pyelftools, capstone, unicorn, pycryptodome, lz4, plistlib.\n50\tMISSING: blutter, reFlutter, pyxamstore, Il2CppDumper/Cpp2IL, frida/frida-tools/objection, apkid, apkleaks, bundletool,\n51\tabe (android-backup-extractor), standalone baksmali/smali, dexdump, zipalign, de4dot, ipsw/plistutil/class-dump.\n52\tTimed constraint: `solve.py` may use only stdlib + lib.* + pyzipper/pyelftools/pefile/capstone/pycryptodome/androguard,\n53\tno subprocess, <1 s per set. Prebuilt extractors must be pure python.\n54\t\n55\t## Concept table\n56\t\n57\tLegend: tool `[i]` = installed here, `[M]` = missing. \"puzzle\" = `assets/huntress_puzzle.json` (`lib.android.puzzle_candidates`).\n58\t\n59\t| # | concept | status | where the answer likely hides | recognition cues | standard tool + exact command | D22+ likelihood |\n60\t|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n61\t| 1 | Exported Activity / implicit-export default | seen D1 | puzzle; real CTFs: `onCreate` reveals the flag when started with a magic extra | `android:exported=\"true\"`, intent-filter w/o `exported` + targetSdk<31 | `aapt dump xmltree x.apk AndroidManifest.xml` [i]; `droidasc getmanifest x.apk` [i]; `lib.android.manifest_facts` | high: Mastery mixes old days |\n62\t| 2 | Exported Service / AIDL / Messenger | gap | `onBind`/`onStartCommand`/`handleMessage` compares + returns secret | `<service exported>`, `extends Binder`, `$Stub`, `IInterface`, `Messenger` | `jadx -d out x.apk` [i]; `droidasc findrefs x.apk type Landroid/os/Binder;` | med: next IPC theme |\n63\t| 3 | Broadcast receiver (exported, dynamic, ordered/sticky) | gap | `onReceive` action/extra check; action strings in dex | `<receiver exported>`, `registerReceiver`, `sendOrderedBroadcast`, custom `ACTION_*` | `aapt dump xmltree ...`; `jadx` grep `onReceive` | med-high: classic unused IPC theme |\n64\t| 4 | Content provider (SQLi, path traversal, FileProvider paths) | seen D6 | puzzle; real: `query()` / `openFile()`, `res/xml/*paths*.xml` | `<provider exported grantUriPermissions>`, `UriMatcher`, `<root-path>`, `../` | `apktool d -f -o out x.apk` [i]; `aapt dump xmltree x.apk res/xml/file_paths.xml` | med (mixed Mastery) |\n65\t| 5 | Custom permission weakness (normal level, typo, missing) | gap | manifest | `<permission protectionLevel=\"normal\">`, `android:permission` on comp vs `uses-permission` | `aapt dump permissions x.apk` [i] | med |\n66\t| 6 | Task hijac