{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgKFo16HjYvfJMsxfKYM1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01G5vhYumzcvGb4LS2jgVZRw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/testpwn/huntress-2026; cat > $TMPDIR/cues.md <<'EOF'\n## Recognition cues (worker quick-reference)\n\n```\n0. Always first: unzip -p x.apk assets/huntress_puzzle.json   (triage.md prints it)\n   v1 {\"codec\":..,\"data\":..} -> python3 -c \"from lib.android import extract_answer as e;print(e('x.apk'))\"; submit ANS-...\n   v2 {\"schema\":\"...v2\",\"codec\":\"analysis\",\"build\":..} NO data (D23 TT + every Mastery set) -> answer is COMPUTED: step 5a.\n   Never chase 127.0.0.1:19090 (device loopback). Never submit a regex-composed ANS- (hex table + dead mixers = decoys).\n1. unzip -l x.apk   -> map the entries:\n   assets/huntress_puzzle.json      v1 codec; data already ANS-? done (D15 native, D19 reflection); new name -> data[:4] vs \"ANS-\"\n                                    data = an entry path (D20 `dynamic`)? open THAT entry, recurse. int list (D5/D17): r[order[i]]=data[i]\n   lib/<abi>/*.so                   strings -a | grep ANS- ; nm -D --defined-only ; no Java_* -> JNI_OnLoad/RegisterNatives\n                                    D16 gate Java_*_native*(int)+*_accepts: objdump -d (bypass len 65536)\n                                    D23 v2 d15 set: Java_*_nativeShare(long) called MID-CHAIN, pure arithmetic: port or unicorn\n   lib/*/libapp.so + libflutter.so  Flutter: strings libapp.so; flutter_assets/kernel_blob.bin (debug = source text)\n   assets/index.android.bundle      RN: head -c8 | xxd; c61fbc03 = Hermes -> hbc-decompiler; else webcrack/js-beautify\n   assemblies/*.dll|*.blob, libmonodroid.so   Xamarin: XALZ = lz4 per-dll; then ilspycmd f.dll\n   libil2cpp.so + global-metadata.dat         Unity IL2CPP: strings global-metadata.dat | grep ANS-\n   assets/www/, cordova.js, capacitor.config  hybrid JS: grep -r in as